<title>INDIA: India's SRF operating profit rises.</title>
<headline>India's SRF operating profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit   1,805.5  vs  1,458.0</p>
<p>    Net sales	    5,575.5  vs  4,844.5</p>
<p>    Interest costs     1,175.0  vs    834.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   467.4  vs    404.0</p>
<p>    Profit before tax    163.1  vs    327.1</p>
<p>NOTE: SRF Ltd, a leading Indian nylon tyre fabric maker, sold its majority stake in SRF Finance during the year. Its depreciation figure includes miscellaneous expense write-offs.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
